    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n3972" root="تفل" body-key="t">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تُفْلٌ</span></b> , (K,) or ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَفْلٌ</span></b> , (M, accord. to the TT,)
and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تُفَالٌ</span></b> , (M, K,) vulgarly ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تِفْلٌ</span></b>  and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تِفَالٌ</span></b> ,
(TA,) <i>Spittle,</i> or <i>saliva, ejected from the mouth;</i>
syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بُصَاقٌ</span>; (M, K;) as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَفَلٌ</span></b> : (Ibn-Abi-l-
Hadeed, TA:) or it is <i>similar to</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بُصَاق</span>. (TA.)
[See 1.] ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And <i>Froth,</i> or <i>foam,</i> (M, K,) of the
sea; (TA;) and <i>the like thereof.</i> (M.)


